Z||000000||jch82||08-08-2001||12:37 PM||||Well I was a little bored before I went to work so I decided to post a few pics...<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/josh_fiero02().jpg"> <P>This is my fiero so far. The front end is all primed up because there was about a 5in crack down the center because the guy I bought it from ran into a traler hitch. It is looking a lot better now! <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fieroparts04().jpg"> <P>This is the truckload of interior parts Ken (MooCow) and I got from the junkyard. I also have a new decklid with a spoiler on it so I don't have to keep the luggage rack on! woohoo! <P>Between my interior and this new interior I'm hoping that I should be able to have a pretty much mint interior!!<BR> <BR>Anyways, thanks for listening....After I get my interior back together, all the extra parts will be for sale!<P>Josh  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P><BR><P>------------------<BR>Mom and Dad they quite don't understand it<BR>ALl the kids they laugh as if they planned it<BR>Why do girls wanna pierce their nose <BR>And walk around in torn pantyhose, oh yeah<BR>                 <I>-Blink 182</I>||||reg||12
