Z||000002||FieroMaster88||08-08-2001||01:15 PM||||WOW!  What did you guys do, take every fiero in the yard apart???  That is a lot of fiero parts.  I am glad you are working so hard on it...cant wait to see it when you get it done!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>            <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/FieroMaster88.gif">            <BR>James Essar<BR>AOL IM Name: FieroMaster88<BR>88 Coupe With a new V6<BR>5 speed Isuzu trans<BR>AcCel 8mm wires<BR>rapid fire plugs<BR>custom intake with K&N filter.<BR>Soon to be 2" closer to the ground and have a turbo||||reg||1
Z||000003||jch82||08-08-2001||07:47 PM||||Steve: It is a standard one. Probably looks odd because I had to sand almost all the pait off in some spots...<P>James: That is the entire interior out of one fiero...It took about 2hrs, that has to be a record! Especially with that heat!<P>Josh  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Mom and Dad they quite don't understand it<BR>ALl the kids they laugh as if they planned it<BR>Why do girls wanna pierce their nose <BR>And walk around in torn pantyhose, oh yeah<BR>                 <I>-Blink 182</I>||||reg||1
